      "title": "Exact 152-point no-three-in-line certificate in G_76",
      "summary": "An exact deterministic integer-arithmetic verifier certifies 152 distinct points in G_76 and checks a nonzero determinant for all 573,800 unordered triples. The baseline verifier does not verify its symmetry marker, though quarter-turn symmetry was checked separately. A replay package republishes the configuration and verifier logic, but strict byte identity and a requested hosted execution are not attested. Its README contains an incorrect baseline transaction identifier. The coordinate set is attributed to Achim Flammenkamp’s database; Robert is credited for the self-contained reproduction and verifier, and the replay transaction for packaging the hosted-verification request.",
